DESCRIPTION >
    - `collection_contributors_geo_distribution.pipe` serves the pie chart of the CNCF report: the organizations active in the CNCF collection over a date range, by country.
    - Reads `cncf_organization_countries_monthly_ds`, rebuilt daily by `cncf_organization_countries_monthly_copy.pipe`; see that pipe for how organizations are placed in countries.
    - An organization active in several months of the range counts once per country. One placed in several countries counts in each, and `contributorPercentage` is a share of the sum of all counts.
    - Dates resolve to whole months, which fits the ranges the report sends.
    - Parameters:
    - `startDate`: Optional DateTime; the range starts with the month containing it (e.g., '2025-11-01 00:00:00'). Defaults to the first month with activity
    - `endDate`: Optional DateTime; only months starting before it are counted (e.g., '2026-10-31 00:00:00'). Defaults to now
    - Response: `country`, `flag`, `country_code`, `contributorCount` (the number of organizations), `contributorPercentage` (rounded, in percent)

TOKEN "insights-app-token" READ

TAGS "Report"

NODE collection_contributors_geo_distribution_result
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        country,
        flag,
        country_code,
        uniqExact(organizationId) AS "contributorCount",
        round("contributorCount" / sum("contributorCount") OVER () * 100) AS "contributorPercentage"
    FROM cncf_organization_countries_monthly_ds
    WHERE
        month
        < {% if defined(endDate) %}
            toDate(
                {{
                    DateTime(
                        endDate,
                        description="Only months starting before this date are counted",
                        required=False,
                    )
                }}
            )
        {% else %} today()
        {% end %}
        {% if defined(startDate) %}
            AND month >= toStartOfMonth(
                toDate(
                    {{
                        DateTime(
                            startDate,
                            description="The range starts with the month containing this date",
                            required=False,
                        )
                    }}
                )
            )
        {% end %}
    GROUP BY country, flag, country_code
    ORDER BY "contributorCount" DESC
